    title: "Qutritium: A Python package for qutrit calibration on IBM Quantum hardware"
    authors:
      - family-names: Pham
        given-names: Son
      - family-names: Nguyen
        given-names: Tien
      - family-names: Bach
        given-names: Bao
    conference:
      name: "Munich Quantum Software Conference"
      city: Munich
      country: DE
    year: 2023
    notes: >-
      Poster presentation. Funded by the Unitary Fund microgrant program.
      The pulse-level calibration code presented at this conference is
      preserved under legacy/ in the v1.0.0 release.

  - type: software
    title: "Qutritium v0.0.1 (Munich poster release)"
    authors:
